.TH FACIAL-AUTH-SETTINGS 1 "2026-11-17" "facial-auth 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
facial-auth-settings \- "Face Login" settings application
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B facial-auth-settings
.SH DESCRIPTION
Graphical front end of
.BR facial-auth (1):
preview the camera, or import photos taken with the Camera application, then
let an administrator link the face to an account.  Also used to test, disable
or remove faces and to choose where the face may be used.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR facial-auth (1)
